<tr><td>Knees</td><td>More bend at the top of the stroke</td><td>Gentler</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>If your goal is all-day movement without changing how you work, an under desk elliptical wins. If you want real exercise sessions while reading or answering email, the FitDesk is the better tool. Our full <a href="/under-desk-elliptical-vs-bike/">under desk elliptical vs bike</a> guide goes further.</p>
